## Model card

- **Name:** Nemotron 3.5 Bolt E4B (4GB)
- **Short description:** NVIDIA's smallest announced Nemotron 3.5 "Bolt" edge model, a ~4GB conversational/physical-agent build. Announced 2026-10-15, scheduled for release 2026-10-23; **not released** as of this report.
- **Provider / access:** Announced for GeForce RTX, Jetson, and RTX/DGX Spark (local); no API or weights published yet.
- **Release / knowledge:** Announced 2026-10-15; release date stated as 2026-10-23. Knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `nemotron-3.5-bolt-e4b` (repo scaffold); no provider/model card published.
- **Context window:** unknown (not disclosed).
- **Modalities:** stated conversational + multi-turn agentic; exact input/output modalities not published (Bolt 74B-A9B sibling is text+image in / text out).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** not released; no pricing published.
- **Architecture:** unknown (a ~4GB edge build; "E4B" naming suggests ~4B active parameters, unconfirmed).

